(7695679, 1261889, 109387, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LevT:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice scene Akex, congratulations on your win! Did you do something special to balance the pier lights with sky,  or it happened naturally? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Lights on the pier were extremely dim, that''s why I tried to shoot a very long exposure... and it worked &amp;#128522;</td>', 'Originally posted by LevT: Nice scene Akex, congratulations on your win! Did you do something special to balance the pier lights with sky,  or it happened naturally?   Lights on the pier were extremely dim, that''s why I tried to shoot a very long exposure... and it worked &#128522;', '2021-06-08 11:42:19.000000', NULL, 0),
