(7695697, 1261899, 67145, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MeMex2:</b></div><hr/><i> This is an adult Burrowing Owl. I was lying in a field photographing baby owls<br/>near their burrows and realized that this guy was sitting on an adjacent house<br/>watching me.<br/>These guys are also called "Urban Owls". Many of them live in crowded suburbs<br/>and are used to human interaction. Because so many empty lots are being developed<br/>the local "Burrowing Owl Association" is offering people money to allow the owls<br/>to live on their property. <br/>Thanks for liking it! It''s my all time favorite. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>thankyou Jane for the backstory .. so interesting  .. :)</td>', 'Originally posted by MeMex2: This is an adult Burrowing Owl. I was lying in a field photographing baby owlsnear their burrows and realized that this guy was sitting on an adjacent housewatching me.These guys are also called "Urban Owls". Many of them live in crowded suburbsand are used to human interaction. Because so many empty lots are being developedthe local "Burrowing Owl Association" is offering people money to allow the owlsto live on their property. Thanks for liking it! It''s my all time favorite.   thankyou Jane for the backstory .. so interesting  .. :)', '2021-06-08 18:21:32.000000', NULL, 0),
